# civil-holidays v1
# jurisdiction: BA
# source: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Public_holidays_in_Bosnia_and_Herzegovina
#   Structure and dates derived from vacanza/holidays 0.101 (MIT)
#   (github.com/vacanza/holidays), an independent open-source reference
#   maintained against each country's official calendar. Primary names are
#   Bosnian, the vacanza default rendering for this jurisdiction; English
#   lands only in translations.tab, never in this column. Hijri holidays
#   (Ramazanski/Kurban Bajram) have no closed-form rule modelled here and
#   are captured as 'decree' (explicit per-year dates, basis tabulated)
#   for 2024-2025. Orthodox Christmas/Good Friday use chronologia's own
#   julian_gregorian_date easter() method for the movable Good Friday,
#   whose -2 offset was independently confirmed to hold in both 2024 and
#   2025; Catholic Easter Monday uses the Gregorian easter() +1 offset.
# retrieved: 2026-07-22
# categories: public|regional|municipal|religious|school
# columns: kind | name | args | categories | subdiv | observed | valid | span
#
